{"about_the_game":"&quot;Pursuer&quot; - psychological horror in which the player has to collect enough evidence to find the culprit. But it will not be so easy to do, since the map is a fairly large open space, in which there are 4 key locations: <u>Hospital</u>, <u>Laundry</u>, <u>Church</u> and <u>Military Hostel</u>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/1eed2641cc577a02ab5e61fe78a236f0.avif?t=1571395585\" width=628 height=98 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/15cc8071ecb4878ffe465e485ad58c77.avif?t=1571395585\" width=628 height=260 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect evidence to reveal the location of the escaped criminal.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/1413fa055c3d8c36e17dc375ce525753.avif?t=1571395585\" width=628 height=98 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/a6c26ca9eb178c4800d038bdd4dc041e.poster.avif?t=1571395585\" width=628 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/a6c26ca9eb178c4800d038bdd4dc041e.webm?t=1571395585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/a6c26ca9eb178c4800d038bdd4dc041e.mp4?t=1571395585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sit by the fire, listen to music, etc., so as not to go crazy.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013660/extras/ace3e33f8c1114c4d5785b4ec8324188.avif?t=15